    "title" "GCL Tweaks"
    "description" "GCL Tweaks provides utility commands and a Trade Statistics dashboard.

Press F9 to toggle console window with Console and Trade tabs.

Trade Tab: View station profits across all sectors in a spreadsheet layout. Automatic scanning every 5 minutes.

Commands:
/gcl_tweak showdroptables - Display system upgrade drop rates
/gcl_tweak setdroprate <component> <multiplier> - Adjust drop rates
/gcl_tweak isobjectwrecked - Check if entity has boarding malus
/gcl_tweak setobjectwrecked 0|1 - Clear/set boarding malus
/gcl_tweak scantrade [0|1] - Toggle automatic trade scanning

Source code available on GitHub."
    "changenote" "CHANGENOTE_PLACEHOLDER"
